# scripts/release.sh's whole staging tree, not just the binary inside it.
# Phase 0 removed a previously-COMMITTED releases/guppyscreen/ (a stray build
# artifact duplicating deleted content); only the binary was ignored before,
# so every other file release.sh stages there still showed up as untracked and
# was committable by accident. That is how it got in the first time.
